00:11.098 --> 00:13.940
Now let's just remind ourselves
what these things look like.

00:13.940 --> 00:14.857
So concave,

00:16.415 --> 00:17.665
concave upwards

00:19.703 --> 00:21.075
is an interval,

00:21.075 --> 00:23.011
an interval when you're concave upwards

00:23.011 --> 00:26.584
