02:42.197 --> 02:43.970
So let's do that.

02:43.970 --> 02:48.222
So let's take the first
derivative, g prime of x,

02:48.222 --> 02:49.951
just gonna apply the power rule a lot.

02:49.951 --> 02:51.290
Four times negative one

02:51.290 --> 02:55.948
is negative four x to the
third power plus, okay,

02:55.948 --> 02:57.480
so you're gonna have two times six

