03:06.235 --> 03:07.758
but that's just minus two.

03:07.758 --> 03:09.655
And then the derivative of
negative three, of a constant

03:09.655 --> 03:10.963
is just zero.

03:10.963 --> 03:15.046
And now I can take the second
derivative, g prime prime of x

03:15.046 --> 03:18.026
is going to be equal to
three times negative four

03:18.026 --> 03:20.026
